This repository contains the data and code to reproduce the results in the paper: 

Title: "Biodiversity modulates the size-abundance relationship in changing environments"
Author(s): Gjoni, Vojsava; Altermatt, Florian; Garnier, Aurélie; Palamara, Gianmarco; Seymour, Mathew; Pontarp, Mikael; Pennekamp, Frank

Instructions:
- The Data folder contains the raw data as a single csv file (Size_abundance_data.csv), as well as a csv file with the metadata (metadata.csv). 
- The Analysis folder contains two R scripts to perform the CCSR analysis and a complementary analysis of species extinctions.
- Main and supplementary figures are generated in the Output folder.

Run the R scripts in the Analysis folder to reproduce the results. Please note that there is a switch (line to uncomment) to reproduce some of the supplementary results.

